#. module: app_odoo_customize
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_odoo_customize/models/res_config_settings.py:0
msgid ""
"This database is now marked as production-like. Anonymized or deleted data "
"cannot be restored automatically. Please review and reconfigure outgoing "
"email servers, payment providers, and other integrations before using it as "
"a real production database."
msgstr ""
"此数据库现已标记为生产环境类型。匿名化或删除的数据无法自动恢复。在将其用作真正的生产数据库之前，请检查并重新配置邮件服务、支付服务和其他功能的参数设置。"

#. module: app_odoo_customize
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:app_odoo_customize.view_app_theme_config_settings
msgid ""
"This operation will convert this database into a test database, deactivate "
"email sending, deactivate payment functions, and cannot be undone on this "
"database."
msgstr "此操作将把当前数据库转换为测试数据库，停用邮件发送功能、停用支付功能。此操作过程中删除的数据无法恢复。"

#. module: app_odoo_customize
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:app_odoo_customize.view_app_theme_config_settings
msgid ""
"This will mark the current database as production-like. It will NOT restore "
"anonymized or deleted data. You MUST manually review and reconfigure "
"outgoing email servers, payment providers, and other integrations before "
"using it as a real production database."
msgstr ""
"此操作将把当前数据设为为生产库。此操作不会恢复匿名化或删除的数据。在将其用作真正的生产数据库之前，请检查并重新配置邮件服务、支付服务和其他功能的参数设置。"

